# Defect 508 and panel 199's R2, ratified 2026-10-09: the price of keeping a
# call a call at `-O2` (`-fno-optimize-sibling-calls`). A correct recursion
# in tail position, which clang turned into a loop at `-O2`, now spends a
# frame a call there as at `-O0`: ten million deep, it printed its sum at
# `-O2` and aborted at `-O0`, and aborts at both now (spec `:280`, one
# meaning at every level). Measured on this Mac on 2026-10-09: twenty
# thousand and fifty thousand deep print at `-O0`, at `-O2` and under both
# sanitised builds, eighty thousand and a hundred thousand abort at `-O0`
# before the flag and after it, and a hundred thousand prints at `-O2` with
# it (`tests/harness/suite_surface.hero`, the `deeptail` row). Twenty
# thousand is the depth this case asks at every level, with room under the
# smallest of them.
function sum_to(n: i64, acc: i64) -> i64
    if n == 0
        return acc
    return sum_to(n: n - 1, acc: acc + n)

function main()
    print(sum_to(n: 20000, acc: 0))
